# Optional. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) for local dev, or add these as GitHub
# Actions repository secrets so every APK build carries them.
#
# When present, the app starts already connected: a freshly installed APK will
# pull your existing study progress from Supabase on first launch instead of
# starting from the seed data. When absent, the app runs local-only.
#
# The anon key is a public client key, but this app's suggested SQL policy is
# `for all using (true)`, which means anyone holding that key can read and write
# the sync row. Prefer repository secrets over committing values here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
